  "verdict": "MileIQ Free covers 40 automatic drives a month at $0, and MileIQ Unlimited costs $139.92 a year on annual billing. TripLog lists unlimited free automatic GPS tracking and Premium at $59.99 a year, while Everlance Starter costs $89.99 a year. Driversnote publishes team licenses at 11 USD per month for 2 to 10 users.\n\nExpensify and Hurdlr pair mileage with expenses or tax tools, MileageWise recovers past years from $229, and Stride is free for 1099 workers. To narrow the MileIQ alternatives, count business drives for one month, then read the free-tier cap and annual price in each table row above.",
